N:HOW READ (2026-11-11): Every bar totals eight eighth units. A, bars 1-4 and 13-16, uses C major with E natural and A natural; B, bars 5-12, uses E flat and A flat. Bars 2, 6, 10 and 14 place a dotted quarter across beat 2 into beat 3; bars 3, 7 and 11 contain paired sixteenths. Final C4 whole note carries a fermata. Melody range C4-C5; ABBA 4+4+4+4.
N:UNCERTAIN: French idiom and sung stress, live major/minor choice, syncopation, synth balance and originality all require named reviewers and a classroom trial.
